# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PERSONAL DATA — never commit
#
# This project reads and writes records about named individuals.
# Everything below stays local. If you are about to force-add
# something here, stop and think about whose name is in it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Rosters: names, advisors, cohort years
data/roster.json
data/*roster*.json
data/cohorts.json
data/*cohorts*.json

# Metric snapshots: per-person publication and citation figures
data/*snapshot*.json
data/phdmetrics-*.json
data/pubwatch-*.json

# Identity decisions: names paired with ORCIDs and human judgements
data/*overrides*.json
data/*review*.json

# Crawl state
data/_*partial*.json
data/*advisors*.json

# Reports naming individuals
*.pdf
reports/

# Local config with your folder IDs and contact email
src/Config.gs
config.gs

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
